- `check_capacity` pure function — no I/O, no side effects
- `_resolve_integration(tool_name)` returns `(integration_name, action_string)` tuple
- The `messages` list at the point of internal action dispatch has: system prompt + masked conversation history + current masked user message + masked LLM assistant turn

